/**
 * Combat rockets — lock-gated homing missiles (WaveKill Assault port).
 *
 * Everyone starts with 1 rocket; track pickups refill. Auto-lock in a forward
 * cone; F fires when ready. Dual-airbrake drift breaks locks and spoils inbound
 * rockets for players and AI alike.
 */

